msgid "# Quick Start"
msgstr "# 快速开始"

msgid ""
"This guide helps you run your first inference workload or deploy an online "
"service on a prepared Ascend host using a prebuilt vLLM Ascend container."
msgstr "本指南帮助您在准备好的Ascend主机上，使用预构建的vLLM Ascend容器运行您的第一个推理工作负载或部署在线服务。"

msgid "## Requirements {: #quick-start-requirements }"
msgstr "## 要求 {: #quick-start-requirements }"

msgid ""
"- Operating system: Linux\n"
"- Python: {{ release_python_version }}\n"
"- Hardware equipped with Ascend NPUs. This guide supports the following devices:"
msgstr ""
"- 操作系统：Linux\n"
"- Python：{{ release_python_version }}\n"
"- 配备Ascend NPU的硬件。本指南支持以下设备："

msgid "| Type | Common products |"
msgstr "| 类型 | 常见产品 |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend A2 series products | Atlas 800T A2, Atlas 900 A2 PoD, Atlas 200T A2"
" Box16, Atlas 300T A2, Atlas 800I A2, and others |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend A2系列产品 | Atlas 800T A2、Atlas 900 A2 PoD、Atlas 200T A2 Box16、Atlas "
"300T A2、Atlas 800I A2等 |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend A3 series products | Atlas 800T A3, Atlas 900 A3 SuperPoD, Atlas "
"9000 A3 SuperPoD, Atlas 800I A3, and others |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend A3系列产品 | Atlas 800T A3、Atlas 900 A3 SuperPoD、Atlas 9000 A3 "
"SuperPoD、Atlas 800I A3等 |"

msgid "| Ascend 310P series products | Atlas 300I DUO and 310P SOC |"
msgstr "| Ascend 310P系列产品 | Atlas 300I DUO和310P SOC |"

msgid "| Ascend 950DT series products | Atlas 950DT |"
msgstr "| Ascend 950DT系列产品 | Atlas 950DT |"

msgid "- Prebuilt vLLM Ascend containers:"
msgstr "- 预构建的vLLM Ascend容器："

msgid "| Hardware | Ubuntu | openEuler |"
msgstr "| 硬件 | Ubuntu | openEuler |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend A2 series products | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version"
" }}-openeuler` |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend A2系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}` | "
"`quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-openeuler` |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend A3 series products | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-a3` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-a3-openeuler` |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend A3系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-a3` "
"| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-a3-openeuler` |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend 310P series products | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-310p` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-310p-openeuler` |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend 310P系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version "
"}}-310p` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version "
"}}-310p-openeuler` |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend 950DT series products | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-950dt` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-950dt-openeuler` |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend 950DT系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version "
"}}-950dt` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-950dt-"
"openeuler` |"

msgid "??? note \"Software versions included in the vLLM Ascend container\""
msgstr "??? note \"vLLM Ascend容器中包含的软件版本\""

msgid "| Software | Default version used in this guide |"
msgstr "| 软件 | 本指南使用的默认版本 |"

msgid "    | Python | `{{ release_image_python_version }}` |"
msgstr "    | Python | `{{ release_image_python_version }}` |"

msgid ""
"    | Ascend HDK | See the [CANN {{ release_cann_version }} "
"documentation](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/{{"
" release_cann_version.replace('.', '') }}/softwareinst/releasenote/{{ "
"release_cann_version }}/release-notes.md) |"
msgstr ""
"    | Ascend HDK | 请参阅[CANN {{ release_cann_version "
"}}文档](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/{{ "
"release_cann_version.replace('.', '') }}/softwareinst/releasenote/{{ "
"release_cann_version }}/release-notes.md) |"

msgid "    | CANN | `{{ release_cann_version }}` |"
msgstr "    | CANN | `{{ release_cann_version }}` |"

msgid "    | TorchNPU | `{{ release_torch_npu_version }}` |"
msgstr "    | TorchNPU | `{{ release_torch_npu_version }}` |"

msgid "    | PyTorch | `{{ release_pytorch_version }}` |"
msgstr "    | PyTorch | `{{ release_pytorch_version }}` |"

msgid "    | NNAL | `{{ release_nnal_version }}` |"
msgstr "    | NNAL | `{{ release_nnal_version }}` |"

msgid ""
"    | Triton Ascend | `{{ release_triton_ascend_version }}` / Not supported "
"on 310P |"
msgstr ""
"    | Triton Ascend | `{{ release_triton_ascend_version }}` / 310P上不支持 |"

msgid "    | vLLM | `{{ vllm_version }}` |"
msgstr "    | vLLM | `{{ vllm_version }}` |"

msgid "    | vLLM Ascend | `{{ vllm_ascend_version }}` |"
msgstr "    | vLLM Ascend | `{{ vllm_ascend_version }}` |"

msgid "## Installation {: #quick-start-installation }"
msgstr "## 安装 {: #quick-start-installation }"

msgid "??? tip \"If image downloads are slow\""
msgstr "??? tip \"如果镜像下载速度较慢\""

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend images are downloaded from `quay.io` by default. If direct "
"access is slow, use one of the following registry mirrors to accelerate the "
"download."
msgstr "vLLM Ascend镜像默认从`quay.io`下载。如果直接访问速度较慢，可以使用以下镜像源之一来加速下载。"

msgid "For example, the original image address is:"
msgstr "例如，原始镜像地址为："

msgid "You can replace it with:"
msgstr "您可以将其替换为："

msgid ""
"Replace only the registry prefix and preserve the complete original image "
"tag, including suffixes such as `-a3`, `-310p`, `-950dt`, and `-openeuler`."
msgstr "仅替换镜像仓库前缀，并保留完整的原始镜像标签，包括`-a3`、`-310p`、`-950dt`和`-openeuler`等后缀。"

