msgid ""
"If the model has already been downloaded locally, replace the model ID in "
"the examples below with the local directory. You do not need to set this "
"environment variable."
msgstr "如果模型已下载到本地，请将以下示例中的模型ID替换为本地目录。您无需设置此环境变量。"

